#: ../../source/getting_started/index.md:13
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "入门指南"

#: ../../source/getting_started/index.md:15
msgid ""
"**Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin (KPP)** is a PyTorch plugin for training and "
"evaluating quantum-native energy models and enhanced AI models on **Special "
"Purpose Quantum Computers (SPQC)**."
msgstr ""
"**Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin（KPP）** 是一个 PyTorch "
"插件，用于在**专用量子计算机（SPQC）**上训练和评估量子原生能量模型及增强型 AI 模型。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/index.md:17
msgid ""
"It offloads Boltzmann sampling to the **Coherent Ising Machine (CIM)** "
"through the Kaiwu SDK, while keeping all other computations, parameter "
"updates, autograd, data loading, in the standard PyTorch workflow."
msgstr ""
"它通过 Kaiwu SDK 将玻尔兹曼采样卸载到**相干伊辛机（CIM）**，同时将所有其他计算、参数更新、自动微分、数据加载保留在标准 PyTorch"
" 工作流中。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/index.md:19
msgid "This guide walks you through the essentials in four parts:"
msgstr "本指南分四部分介绍核心内容："

#: ../../source/getting_started/index.md:31
msgid "Prerequisite"
msgstr "预备知识"

#: ../../source/getting_started/index.md:33
msgid ""
"Before proceeding, ensure you have basic knowledge of energy-based models "
"and Boltzmann machines.   Please read the [Prerequisites](background.md), it"
" covers the essentials of RBM and energy functions.   For a deeper dive into"
" the statistical physics and neural network foundations, see the "
"[Theoretical Foundations](../theoretical-foundations/index.md)."
msgstr ""
"在继续之前，请确保您具备能量基模型和玻尔兹曼机的基础知识。请阅读[预备知识](background.md)，其中涵盖了 RBM "
"与能量函数的要点。如需深入了解统计物理与神经网络基础，请参阅[理论基础](../theoretical-foundations/index.md)。"

